{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:36:46+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "0a91e3fbc484ac0a12de566273f7bad6", "span_id": "d013377cf43f3636", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "D25D8C06", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_2b613788-5643-4bf3-bbe0-46b2a4ebda48', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"What is the pricing floor for a BB-rated loan?\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:36:46+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "0a91e3fbc484ac0a12de566273f7bad6", "span_id": "d013377cf43f3636", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "D25D8C06", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_2b613788-5643-4bf3-bbe0-46b2a4ebda48', 'response': 'According to the **FAB Credit Pricing Policy (v2.4)**, the pricing floors for a **BB-rated** client depend on the facility type and tenor. All spreads are applied as a minimum margin over the internal Funds Transfer Pricing (FTP) rate.\\n\\n### 1. Corporate Term Loans\\n*(Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 · Table 3.1)*\\n\\n| Tenor | Minimum Pricing Floor (Over FTP) |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| **≤ 1 Year** | **165 bps** |\\n| **1 – 3 Years** | **210 bps** |\\n| **3 – 5 Years** | **260 bps** |\\n| **> 5 Years** | **320 bps** |\\n\\n### 2. Revolving Credit Facilities (RCFs)\\n*(Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 · Table 3.2)*\\n\\nTenor ≤ 3 Years:\\n* **Drawn Margin Floor:** 160 bps\\n* **Commitment Fee Floor (Undrawn):** 40 bps\\n* **Facility Fee Floor:** 20 bps\\n\\nTenor > 3 Years:\\n* Add **40 bps** to the drawn margin floor, and additional upsizes for commitment/facility fees as stipulated in the policy.\\n\\n**Important Notes:**\\n* These represent the absolute minimum all-in spreads; pricing below these thresholds requires a formal **Pricing Exception** and elevated credit committee approval. \\n* A **Relationship Value adjustment** may reduce the required margin by up to **25 bps** from the standard floor, provided the relationship generates over AED 500,000 in annual cross-sell revenue and receives appropriate credit approval. *(Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 · Section 2.4)*'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:36:48+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "0a91e3fbc484ac0a12de566273f7bad6", "span_id": "d013377cf43f3636", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "D25D8C06", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**Pricing Floors for BB‑Rated Loans (FAB Credit Pricing Policy\\u202fv2.4)**  \\n\\n| Facility Type | Tenor | Minimum Pricing Floor (over FTP) |\\n|---------------|-------|-----------------------------------|\\n| **Corporate Term Loan** | ≤\\u202f1\\u202fYear | **165\\u202fbps** |\\n|  | 1\\u202f–\\u202f3\\u202fYears | **210\\u202fbps** |\\n|  | 3\\u202f–\\u202f5\\u202fYears | **260\\u202fbps** |\\n|  | >\\u202f5\\u202fYears | **320\\u202fbps** |\\n| **Revolving Credit Facility (RCF)** | ≤\\u202f3\\u202fYears – Drawn Margin | **160\\u202fbps** |\\n|  | ≤\\u202f3\\u202fYears – Commitment Fee (undrawn) | **40\\u202fbps** |\\n|  | ≤\\u202f3\\u202fYears – Facility Fee | **20\\u202fbps** |\\n|  | >\\u202f3\\u202fYears – Drawn Margin | **200\\u202fbps** (baseline\\u202f160\\u202fbps\\u202f+\\u202f40\\u202fbps) |\\n|  | >\\u202f3\\u202fYears – Commitment/Facility Fees | Adjusted per policy (see Table\\u202f3.2) |\\n\\n**Key Points**\\n\\n- The figures above are *absolute minimum spreads* that must be applied over FAB’s internal Funds Transfer Pricing (FTP) rate.  \\n- Pricing **below** these floors requires a formal **Pricing Exception** and elevated credit‑committee approval.  \\n- A **Relationship Value adjustment** can reduce the required floor by up to **25\\u202fbps** when the client generates\\u202f>\\u202fAED\\u202f500,000 annual cross‑sell revenue and receives the appropriate credit approval. *(FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 – Section\\u202f2.4)*  \\n\\n**Interpretation**\\n\\n- For a BB‑rated **corporate term loan** of 2\\u202fyears, the lowest permissible spread is **210\\u202fbps** over FTP (subject to any approved relationship‑value reduction).  \\n- For a BB‑rated **revolving facility** with a tenor ≤\\u202f3\\u202fyears, the lowest drawn‑margin spread is **160\\u202fbps** (or **200\\u202fbps** if tenor\\u202f>\\u202f3\\u202fyears), plus the applicable commitment and facility fee floors.  \\n\\nThese floors are the minimum rates you can offer; any lower rate would be non‑compliant without an approved exception.'}]}"}
