{"ts": "2026-06-29T14:59:10+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "6321fb9e6b271fed80062db6a0a2454c", "span_id": "4f0074dcd5c977be", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "3EA99AC3", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_497f4fbc-4b06-4629-9242-8ee53ba30c1c', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"Pricing floor (minimum spread over FTP) for A-rated AED corporate loans FAB Credit Pricing Policy\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-29T14:59:10+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "6321fb9e6b271fed80062db6a0a2454c", "span_id": "4f0074dcd5c977be", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "3EA99AC3", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_497f4fbc-4b06-4629-9242-8ee53ba30c1c', 'response': \"Based on the **FAB Credit Pricing Policy (v2.4)**, the standard minimum pricing floors for A-rated Corporate Term Loans are set as the following spreads over the applicable Funds Transfer Pricing (FTP) rate, based on the facility's contractual tenor:\\n\\n* **Tenor ≤ 1 Year:** 85 bps over FTP\\n* **Tenor 1-3 Years:** 105 bps over FTP\\n* **Tenor 3-5 Years:** 130 bps over FTP\\n* **Tenor > 5 Years:** 165 bps over FTP\\n\\n**Additional Policy Notes:**\\n* **Source:** `FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4`, Section 3.1, Table 3.1 (*Corporate Term Loans*).\\n* **Relationship Value Adjustment:** Per Section 2.4, the required margin may be reduced by **up to 25 bps** from these standard floors if the client demonstrates documented cross-sell revenues exceeding AED 500,000 per annum, subject to credit authority approval and annual review.\\n* **Pricing Exceptions:** Any pricing below these floors (after adjustments) requires a formally documented Pricing Exception approved at the relevant authority level (Section 6).\\n* **FTP Reference:** Ensure you pull the current matched-maturity AED FTP rate from the Treasury portal at the time of term sheet issuance, as FTP rates are updated monthly.\"}]}"}
