{"ts": "2026-06-29T14:59:44+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "6321fb9e6b271fed80062db6a0a2454c", "span_id": "4f0074dcd5c977be", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "3EA99AC3", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**Deal‑specific figures for CUST002 (Falcon Steel Industries)** – *source: query_structured_data*  \\n\\n| Field | Value |\\n|---|---|\\n| deal_id | DEAL005 |\\n| deal_date | 2025‑10‑24 00:00:00 |\\n| customer_id | CUST002 |\\n| customer_name | Falcon Steel Industries |\\n| customer_segment | Corporate |\\n| region | Abu Dhabi |\\n| risk_category | Low |\\n| internal_rating | A |\\n| product_id | PROD002 |\\n| product_type | Loan |\\n| currency | AED |\\n| tenor | 12M |\\n| requested_amount | 58,000,000 |\\n| funding_cost_pct | 5.55% |\\n| risk_premium_pct | 0.1% |\\n| relationship_discount_pct | 0.45% |\\n| recommended_price_pct | 7.3% |\\n| final_approved_price_pct | 7.25% |\\n| expected_margin_pct | 1.35% |\\n| deal_outcome | Won |\\n| benchmark_rate_pct_treasury | 5.35% |\\n| funding_cost_pct_treasury | 5.55% |\\n| net_margin_pct | 1.15% |\\n| spread_over_benchmark_pct | 1.9% |\\n| margin_vs_recommended_pct | -0.05% |\\n\\n**Offered spread over FTP** – *source: query_structured_data*  \\n“The offered spread over FTP (Funds Transfer Pricing) for this deal is **1.70%**. This is calculated by subtracting the internal funding cost/FTP rate (`funding_cost_pct_treasury`: 5.55%) from the final approved price (`final_approved_price_pct`: 7.25%).”\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Pricing‑floor rule for A‑rated AED corporate loans** – *source: query_knowledge_base (FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section\\u202f3.1, Table\\u202f3.1)*  \\n\\n- Tenor ≤\\u202f1\\u202fYear: **85\\u202fbps** over FTP  \\n- Tenor 1‑3\\u202fYears: **105\\u202fbps** over FTP  \\n- Tenor 3‑5\\u202fYears: **130\\u202fbps** over FTP  \\n- Tenor\\u202f>\\u202f5\\u202fYears: **165\\u202fbps** over FTP  \\n\\n*Additional note (Section\\u202f2.4):* “The required margin may be reduced by **up to 25\\u202fbps** from these standard floors if the client demonstrates documented cross‑sell revenues exceeding AED\\u202f500,000 per annum, subject to credit‑authority approval.”\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Compliance Verdict\\n\\n- **Applicable floor:** CUST002’s loan has a tenor of 12\\u202fmonths (≤\\u202f1\\u202fYear) → floor = **85\\u202fbps**.  \\n- **Maximum allowed reduction:** 85\\u202fbps\\u202f‑\\u202f25\\u202fbps = **60\\u202fbps** (if relationship‑value adjustment is approved).  \\n- **Offered spread:** **170\\u202fbps** (1.70\\u202f%).  \\n\\n**Result:** **Compliant** – the offered spread of 170\\u202fbps is well above both the standard floor (85\\u202fbps) and the most permissive adjusted floor (60\\u202fbps). No pricing exception is required.'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-29T14:59:44+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "6321fb9e6b271fed80062db6a0a2454c", "span_id": "c0d8280e0e985019", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "3EA99AC3", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_29885a89-8019-4233-a526-2402d49214a5', 'name': 'query_structured_data', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"Retrieve the latest loan deal details for customer CUST002, including loan rating, currency, tenor, and the offered spread over FTP.\"}'}]}"}
