{"ts": "2026-06-29T16:24:41+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "81066e191892b38e36f55158d45bfb51", "span_id": "0cec519a5535abe3", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "700A555E", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_95797e1e-523f-42ef-ac77-7da7a327861f', 'response': 'Here is the complete customer profile and financial metrics for **CUST003**:\\n\\n| Field | Value | Source |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **customer_id** | CUST003 | customer_360 |\\n| **customer_name** | Gulf Star Logistics | customer_360 |\\n| **customer_segment** | Corporate | customer_360 |\\n| **industry** | Logistics | customer_360 |\\n| **region** | Dubai | customer_360 |\\n| **preferred_currency** | AED | customer_360 |\\n| **risk_category** | Medium | customer_360 |\\n| **internal_rating** | BBB+ | customer_360 |\\n| **relationship_tenure_years** | 7 | customer_360 |\\n| **relationship_status** | Existing | customer_360 |\\n| **relationship_discount_pct** | 0.3 | customer_360 |\\n| **annual_revenue_aed** | 82000000 | customer_360 |\\n| **debt_to_equity_ratio** | 0.48 | customer_360 |\\n| **credit_score** | 720 | customer_360 |\\n| **existing_exposure_aed** | 16000000 | customer_360 |\\n| **total_deals** | 4 | customer_360 |\\n| **won_deals** | 4.0 | customer_360 |\\n| **lost_deals** | 0.0 | customer_360 |\\n| **total_deal_volume_aed** | 63500000.0 | customer_360 |\\n| **avg_deal_size_aed** | 15875000.0 | customer_360 |\\n| **avg_expected_margin_pct** | 1.65 | customer_360 |\\n| **avg_approved_price_pct** | 7.737499999999999 | customer_360 |\\n| **avg_relationship_discount_pct** | 0.3 | customer_360 |\\n| **last_deal_date** | 2025-12-22 00:00:00 | customer_360 |\\n| **win_rate_pct** | 100.0 | customer_360 |\\n\\n*Source: customer_360*'}]}"}
